  "description": "A senior letterman jacket marks a graduating year with a personal detail chosen by the wearer. This black and gold style suits senior groups and individual students, with one chenille graduation year patch included in your chosen year.\n\nDetails\n- Body: black 24 oz melton wool\n- Sleeves: gold genuine cowhide leather\n- Trim: black and gold striped knit collar, cuffs and waistband\n- Lining: quilted lining\n- Closure: snap-button front\n- Pockets: two welt pockets\n- Fit: True-to-size fit; compare your measurements with the size guide\n- Sizes: XXS through 6XL\n\nCustomization options\n- Chenille letter and name embroidery\n- Number, patches and back lettering\n- Free digital design proof before production.\n\nExplore senior varsity jacket styling or class of 2027 letterman jacket styling or black and gold letterman jacket with your own personal details. Choose your layout through our [custom letterman jacket](/custom-letterman-jackets) options and review the placement before production.\n\nProduction and delivery\nMade in our Sialkot factory. Made in 6–7 business days after design approval. Delivery in 5–7 business days.",
